<title>USA: Franklin ends proposed VPTI acquisition.</title>
<headline>Franklin ends proposed VPTI acquisition.</headline>
<dateline>BURLINGTON, N.J. 1997-04-09</dateline>
<text>
<p>Franklin Electronic Publishers Inc said Wednesday that it has ended its proposed acquisition of Voice Powered Technology International Inc.</p>
<p>The company did not give a reason for its decision and could not be immediately reached for comment.</p>
<p>Franklin, the world's largest publisher of electronic books, and Voice Powered, a producer of voice activated products, announced their plans to merge in February.</p>
</text>
